{"ex-E203-1":{"id":"ex-E203-1","chapter":"E203","number":1,"title":"表面面積與體積之比","question":"<p>(a) 某立方體邊長 1 cm，求立方體的表面面積與體積之比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 某立方體邊長 1 nm，求立方體的表面面積與體積之比 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>總表面面積</mtext><mtext>體積</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{總表面面積}{體積}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6 \\times  (0.01)^{2}}{(0.01)^{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 600 m<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>總表面面積</mtext><mtext>體積</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{總表面面積}{體積}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6 \\times  (1 \\times  10^{-9})^{2}}{(1 \\times  10^{-9})^{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6 × 10<sup>9</sup> m<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> : <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6 × 10<sup>9</sup> : 600 = 10<sup>7</sup> : 1</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>立方體有 6 個表面。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"793a7cd877a950fbd89dc714c9aeb608a1866b52f8eb6a973780ae618d9971b0","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,163.4659951171875,557.6491,280.78179931640625],"text":"例 題 1 表面面積與體積之比\r\n(a) 某立方體邊長 1 cm，求立方體的表面面積與體積之比 R1。\r\n(b) 某立方體邊長 1 nm，求立方體的表面面積與體積之比 R2。\r\n(c) 求 R2：R1。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,280.78179931640625,557.6491,408.1609951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) R1 = 總表面面積\r\n體積 = 6 × (0.01)2\r\n(0.01)3 = 600 m–1\r\n(b) R2 = 總表面面積\r\n體積 = 6 × (1 × 10–9)\r\n2\r\n(1 × 10–9)\r\n3 = 6 × 109\r\n m–1\r\n(c) R2 : R1 = 6 × 109\r\n : 600 = 107\r\n : 1\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"tips","box":[40,159.4659951171875,176.6491,408.1609951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n立方體有6個面。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E203-2":{"id":"ex-E203-2","chapter":"E203","number":2,"title":"切割立方體","question":"<p>某立方體邊長 1 cm。若把它切割成多個邊長為 (a) 0.5 cm 或 (b) 1 nm 的立方體，所得立方體的總表面面積與原來的總表面面積之比分別是多少？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 各邊上的立方體數目 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1 cm}{0.5 cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2</p><p>∴ 切割後的立方體總數 = (2)<sup>3</sup> = 8</p><p>總表面面積之比 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.005</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6(0.005)^{2} \\times  8}{6(0.01)^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2</p><p>(b) 各邊上的立方體數目 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1 cm}{1 nm}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.01 m}{10^{-9} m}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 10<sup>7</sup></p><p>∴ 切割後的立方體總數 = (10<sup>7</sup>)<sup>3</sup> = 10<sup>21</sup></p><p>總表面面積之比 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>21</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6(10^{-9})^{2} \\times  10^{21}}{6(0.01)^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 10<sup>7</sup></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b5513f9cd304e2df2aa9c1d6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:174.8px\"></p><p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/c3d39ff6ebacf9a4bee4fd6e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:180.9px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"793a7cd877a950fbd89dc714c9aeb608a1866b52f8eb6a973780ae618d9971b0","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,419.2848951171875,557.4491,524.6009826660156],"text":"例 題 2 切割立方體\r\n某立方體邊長 1 cm。若把它切割成多個邊長為 (a) 0.5 cm 或 (b) \r\n1 nm 的立方體，所得立方體的總表面面積與原來的總表面面積之比\r\n分別是多少？\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,524.6009826660156,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 各邊上的立方體數目 = 1 cm\r\n0.5 cm = 2\r\n∴ 切割後的立方體總數 = (2)3\r\n = 8\r\n總表面面積之比 = 6(0.005)2\r\n × 8\r\n6(0.01)2 = 2\r\n(b) 各邊上的立方體數目 = 1 cm\r\n1 nm = 0.01 m\r\n10–9 m\r\n = 107\r\n∴ 切割後的立方體總數 = (107\r\n)\r\n3\r\n = 1021\r\n總表面面積之比 = 6(10–9)\r\n2\r\n × 1021\r\n6(0.01)2 = 107\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"tips","box":[40,415.2848951171875,176.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n2\r\n2\r\n2\r\n提提你\r\n107\r\n107\r\n107\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E203-3":{"id":"ex-E203-3","chapter":"E203","number":3,"title":"人眼的分辨率","question":"<p>偉成的眼睛離物體 25 cm。由物體反射的光波長為 500 nm，偉成瞳孔的直徑為 5 mm。</p><p>(a) 根據瑞利判據，估算偉成眼睛的角解像度 θ<sub>R</sub>。</p><p>(b) 估算偉成眼睛能分辨物體上兩點的最短距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(c) 如果偉成走到離物體較遠的位置，θ<sub>R</sub> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 會怎樣改變？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) θ<sub>R</sub> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22λ}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22(500 \\times  10^{-9})}{5 \\times  10^{-3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.22 × 10<sup>–4</sup> rad</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>θ <sub>R</sub> = (0.25)(1.22 × 10<sup>–4</sup>) = 3.05 × 10<sup>–5</sup> m</p><p>(c) θ<sub>R</sub> 保持不變，因它不受 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 影響。</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>θ <sub>R</sub>，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 隨 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 增加。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"793a7cd877a950fbd89dc714c9aeb608a1866b52f8eb6a973780ae618d9971b0","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,214.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 3 人眼的分辨率\r\n偉成的眼睛離物體 25 cm。由物體反射的光波長為 500 nm，偉成瞳\r\n孔的直徑為 5 mm。\r\n(a) 根據瑞利判據，估算偉成眼睛的角解像度 θ R。\r\n(b) 估算偉成眼睛能分辨物體上兩點的最短距離 s。\r\n(c) 如果偉成走到離物體較遠的位置，θ R 和 s 會怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,214.81610107421875,562.4491,344.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) θ R ≈ 1.22λ\r\nd = 1.22(500 × 10–9)\r\n5 × 10–3 = 1.22 × 10–4 rad\r\n(b) s ≈ rθ R = (0.25)(1.22 × 10–4) = 3.05 × 10–5 m\r\n(c) θ R 保持不變，因它不受 r 影響。\r\n根據 s ≈ rθ R，s 隨 r 增加。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E203-4":{"id":"ex-E203-4","chapter":"E203","number":4,"title":"相機的分辨率","question":"<p>兩盞相距 1 m 的燈，各發出波長為 590 nm 的光。在 9 km 外有一部相機，它的孔徑直徑為 6.2 mm。</p><p>相機</p><p>km</p><p>(a) 根據瑞利判據，相機的角解像度 θ<sub>R</sub> 是多少？</p><p>(b) 相機無法分辨這兩盞燈。試解釋。</p><p>(c) 舉出一個讓相機能分辨這兩盞燈的方法。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/da27efb8b5c9da4950002ef6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:401.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) θ<sub>R</sub> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22λ}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>590</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6.2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22(590 \\times  10^{-9})}{6.2 \\times  10^{-3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.16 × 10<sup>–4</sup> rad</p><p>(b) 相機可分辨的最小距離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>θ <sub>R</sub> = (9000)(1.16 × 10<sup>–4</sup>) = 1.04 m 由於兩盞燈之間的距離小於 1.04 m，因此相機無法分辨它們。</p><p>(c) 將相機移近燈。 / 增加兩盞燈之間的距離。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"793a7cd877a950fbd89dc714c9aeb608a1866b52f8eb6a973780ae618d9971b0","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.449,365.0719951171875,562.4490000000001,591.7478942871094],"text":"例 題 4 相機的分辨率\r\n兩盞相距 1 m 的燈，各發出波長為 590 nm 的光。在 9 km 外有一部\r\n相機，它的孔徑直徑為 6.2 mm。\r\n1 m\r\n9 km\r\n燈\r\n相機\r\n燈\r\n(a) 根據瑞利判據，相機的角解像度 θ R 是多少？\r\n(b) 相機無法分辨這兩盞燈。試解釋。\r\n(c) 舉出一個讓相機能分辨這兩盞燈的方法。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.449,591.7478942871094,562.4490000000001,743.2849951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) θ R ≈ 1.22λ\r\nd = 1.22(590 × 10–9)\r\n6.2 × 10–3 = 1.16 × 10–4 rad\r\n(b) 相機可分辨的最小距離 s\r\n = rθ R = (9000)(1.16 × 10–4) = 1.04 m \r\n由於兩盞燈之間的距離小於 1.04 m，因此相機無法分辨它們。\r\n(c) 將相機移近燈。 / 增加兩盞燈之間的距離。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E203-5":{"id":"ex-E203-5","chapter":"E203","number":5,"title":"透射電子顯微鏡的分辨率","question":"<p>某透射電子顯微鏡中，電子槍陰極和陽極之間的加速電壓為 40 kV。</p><p>電子從陰極射出時，初動能可略去不計。取電子的電荷和質量為–1.60 × 10<sup>–19</sup> C 和 9.11 × 10<sup>–31</sup> kg，普朗克常數為 6.63 × 10<sup>–34</sup> J s。</p><p>(a) 求電子離開電子槍時，它的速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和德布羅意波長 λ。</p><p>(b) 根據瑞利判據，估算透射電子顯微鏡的角解像度 θ<sub>R</sub>。取孔徑的直徑為 10 cm。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 獲得的動能 = 損失的電勢能</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mv^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">eV</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\frac{2eV}{m}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.60</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>9.11</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{ \\frac{2(1.60 \\times  10^{-19})(40 \\times  10^{3})}{9.11 \\times  10^{-31}} }</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.185 × 10<sup>8</sup> m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>λ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{h}{mv}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6.63</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>9.11</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1.185</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{6.63 \\times  10^{-34}}{(9.11 \\times  10^{-31})(1.185 \\times  10^{8})}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.14 × 10<sup>–12</sup> m</p><p>(b) θ<sub>R</sub> ≈ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22λ}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.22</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6.14</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.22(6.14 \\times  10^{-12})}{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 7.49 × 10<sup>–11</sup> rad</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E203_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"793a7cd877a950fbd89dc714c9aeb608a1866b52f8eb6a973780ae618d9971b0","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,224.81610107421875],"text":"例 題 5 透射電子顯微鏡的分辨率\r\n某透射電子顯微鏡中，電子槍陰極和陽極之間的加速電壓為 40 kV。\r\n電子從陰極射出時，初動能可略去不計。取電子的電荷和質量為\r\n–1.60 × 10–19 C 和9.11 × 10–31 kg，普朗克常數為6.63 × 10–34 J s。\r\n(a) 求電子離開電子槍時，它的速率 v 和德布羅意波長 λ。\r\n(b) 根據瑞利判據，估算透射電子顯微鏡的角解像度 θ R。取孔徑的直\r\n徑為 10 cm。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,224.81610107421875,562.4491,427.4998951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 獲得的動能 = 損失的電勢能\r\n 1\r\n2 mv2\r\n = eV\r\n∴ v = • 2eV\r\nm = •\r\n2(1.60 × 10−19\r\n)(40 × 103\r\n)\r\n9.11 × 10−31 = 1.185 × 108\r\n m s–1\r\nλ = h\r\nmv = 6.63 × 10–34\r\n(9.11 × 10−31)(1.185 × 108\r\n)\r\n = 6.14 × 10–12 m\r\n(b) θ R ≈ 1.22λ\r\nd = 1.22(6.14 × 10–12)\r\n0.1\r\n = 7.49 × 10–11 rad\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}